    "body": "<!-- agent-note:v1 agent=repo-worker-code lane=any-c state=done task=17303 -->\n**Shepherd outcome — landed (task 17303, lane any-c, 2026-11-16)**\n\nPR #7656 MERGED, merge sha `f64cd22b4f0dda3b522c5461a8bdf70fa5715676`.\n\nCodex P2 dispositions (each answered on its review thread):\n\n1. *Runs entering evaluation* — already addressed on the branch by commit 2a48101f81 (#8062), which added §3.2.1–§3.2.3 (run generation, compilation inputs/outputs, freshness/pairing). No further change needed.\n2. *Index pinning* — fixed in 73bee4cb2f (§3.2.1): the pin is on the raw corpus (`corpus_commit` content), each stack builds its own index (chunking policy + embedding model recorded as the index-build identity in the run manifest), and qrel mapping under re-chunking is defined by source-span overlap with rankings emitted in judged-span identities.\n\nThe design was absent on main and #6046 remains open for the design's implementation follow-ons.\n",
